WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Rundoo is the bike shop POS that runs the whole store. Parts research, stock checks and quotes run themselves. Here's a custom job.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Maya wants easier gears for a hilly tour. About two-fifty, in three weeks. Type it in and hit Find parts.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Rundoo pulls what's on the bike and asks the one thing it can't know. Short cage.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
It recommends an 11-34 cassette, a GS derailleur and a spacer, with the reason and Shimano's specs.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
That cassette has to be ordered. The 11-30 is already on your shelf and works with her derailleur. Pick it, and the extra parts drop off.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Add the chain. Labor fills in at your shop rate. No catalogs, no supplier sites.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Send it. Maya gets the itemized quote by text.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.000
She taps approve, and it's on the work order. Pull the parts and get back to the bike.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Rundoo for Bike Shops. Less time at the screen, more time on the bike.
